  <image-generation>
    <model>gpt-image-2 (via Higgsfield)</model>
    <reference-images>
      <ref id="elena-higgsfield" required="true">Reference Elena caricate in Higgsfield</ref>
    </reference-images>
    <prompt-elaborate language="en">
      <![CDATA[
A 45-year-old Italian woman (use Elena Higgsfield reference) holding her smartphone showing a screen full of fitness/diet app icons (multiple colorful generic-looking app squares organized in a folder labeled "Fitness" or just visible on home screen). Her expression: direct knowing slight smile, raised eyebrow, "we both know how this ended" coach energy. She tilts the phone toward camera so screen content is visible.

She wears practical home clothes (simple top, comfortable). Clean modern home setting, neutral background, soft natural daylight. NEUTRAL color, NOT golden Mediterranean.

CRITICAL STYLE: COACH talking-head Instagram energy. Real Italian woman 45, no retouching. App icons visible but not real recognizable brand logos (use generic colorful tile shapes).

Composition: Elena chest-up center frame, phone visible held up showing screen with apps grid, plenty of negative space top/bottom for brand overlay.
      ]]>
    </prompt-elaborate>
    <negative-prompt>cinematic editorial, dramatic blue glow phone, Spike Jonze, model thin, real recognizable app brand logos visible, instagram filter, makeup heavy</negative-prompt>
    <output-specs><aspect-ratio>1:1</aspect-ratio><resolution>1080x1080</resolution><variations-to-generate>4</variations-to-generate></output-specs>
  </image-generation>

